s based on these data were adjusted for nonresponse using the inverse of the response rate, stratified by school type\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Weights were calculated to account for sample design and adjusted for nonresponse.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"SAS software (version 9.4; SAS Institute) was used for all analyses.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}